    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108716" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπολογ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>take account of,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινος</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1325a39
			</span></i> (cod.Sb, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιεῖν</span> cett.;
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπόλογον ποιεῖσθαι</span> Madvig).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>deduct,</i> esp. from a sum due, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπολογεῖν αὐτοῖς τὰς ζημίας ἐκ τῶν
					μισθῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					12(9).207.73
				</span></i>
			 (Eretria, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
				257.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				317.11
			</span></i>, al. <span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PRev.Laws</u>
				28.16
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PTeb.</u>
				61
			</span></i>(b).<i><span class="en">
				391
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				72.396
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>: <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				2.122
			</span></i> cites <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπολογεῖν</span> (dub.
			sens., v. l. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπολέγειν</span>) from <i><span class="en">
				Theopomp.Com.
				96
			</span></i>.</div>
